	(text "Interface board - terminates the machine cables, feeds the RP23U5XBB.\nColumn pairs X Y1 Y2 Z B; Y1 -> controller Y, Y2 -> controller A.\nRJ45: 1 Step, 3 En, 5 Dir, 7 AL (striped = signal), evens GND.\n3P: 1 = 12V, 2 = signal, 3 = GND (SN04: brown / black / blue).\nPassive - no actives, 12V arrives regulated from the existing buck."
		(at 20 14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.2 2.2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b31cb39c-d626-4171-946b-fcc6026fdd8e")
	)
